&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable operating in ambiguous problem spaces, balancing long-term platform strategy with pragmatic execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with schema design, metadata systems, OpenTelemetry, observability platforms, knowledge graphs, or AI-assisted developer tooling is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
